ss=\"so-panel widget widget_text panel-first-child\" data-index=\"0\" ><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Millstone Township, NJ<\/h3>\t\t\t<div class=\"textwidget\"><p>Our goal at Mousemoor is to breed a small all-around working terrier. My terriers have the mind and drive to do anything asked of them. They work in Obedience, Barn Hunt, GTG, Nosework, as well as work in the field. Temperament is very important, as they assist me in training other dogs. They live in my home as constant companions.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div><div id=\"panel-3493-0-0-1\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_text panel-last-child\" data-index=\"1\" >\t\t\t<div class=\"textwidget\"><h4>My Boys:<\/h4>\n<p><strong>MOUSEMOOR CAYMUS,<\/strong> <em>12\u00bd&#8221;, Tricolor, Rough<\/em><br \/>\n<em>(Mousemoor Geranimo x Mousemoor Contessa) NHC<br \/>\n(Co-owned with Carolyn Mendlow)<\/em><\/p>\n<p><strong>MOUSEMOOR GERONIMO,<\/strong> <em>12\u00be&#8221;, Tricolor, Broken<\/em><br \/>\n<em>(Mousemoor Mick x Carriagehouse IzzieBee) Bronze<\/em><br \/>\n<em>(Co-owned with Beth Logue)<\/em><\/p>\n<h4>Our Bitches:<\/h4>\n<p><strong>MOUSEMOOR POCO,<\/strong> <em>11\u00be&#8221;, Tricolor, Broken<\/em><br \/>\n<em>(Mousemoor Geronimo x Mousemoor Contessa) NHC<\/em><\/p>\n<p><strong>MOUSEMOOR MOONBEAM,<\/strong> <em>12&#8243;, Tricolor, Broken<\/em><br \/>\n<em>(Hart Farms Abraham x Carriagehouse IzzieBee)<\/em><\/p>\n<h4>Introducing:<\/h4>\n<p><strong>MOUSEMOOR PADFOOT<\/strong><em><br \/>\n<\/em><em>(Sea Dog Captain Morgan x Mousemoor Moonbeam)<br \/>\n<\/em><\/p>\n<p>All terriers are BAER, DM, SCA, and PLL tested &#8211; CERF&#8217;d annually.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-3493-0-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-3493-0-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image panel-first-child\" data-index=\"2\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-8b5b6f678277-3493\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tsrc=\"https:\/\/w