-title\">Cochranville, PA<\/h3>\t\t\t<div class=\"textwidget\"><p>Venery terriers are bred and raised in the rolling hills of Chester County, PA, horse country. We strive to produce terriers of exceptional temperament and conformation that can excel in a wide range of interests, including terrier trials, the hunt field, and loving companionship.<\/p>\n<p>All puppies are raised in our home and carefully socialized with our extended family and friends. All breeding stock BAER normal, CERF normal, and PLL, SCA, DM, and NNA tested or normal by descent. All puppies are BAER tested, examined, and covered by a two-year health guarantee. Lifetime support for all of our terriers is just a phone call away. Please come and visit and meet our terriers!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div><div id=\"panel-3209-0-0-1\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_text panel-last-child\" data-index=\"1\" >\t\t\t<div class=\"textwidget\"><h4>Our Girls:<\/h4>\n<p><strong>VENERY AMARETTO,\u00a0<\/strong><em>12&#8243;, Tan\/White\/Smooth<br \/>\n(Quinn&#8217;s Hammond&#8217;s Aiken x Venery Pi)<\/em><\/p>\n<p><strong>VENERY MARBLE,\u00a0<\/strong><em>13&#8243;, Tricolor, Broken<br \/>\n(Venery Monty x Venery Mel)<\/em><\/p>\n<p><strong>LATEST ADDITION PIXEL,\u00a0<\/strong><em>12&#8243;, Tricolor, Rough<br \/>\n(Venery Pike x Venery Vexy)<\/em><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-3209-0-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-3209-0-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image panel-first-child\" data-index=\"2\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-8b5b6f678277-3209\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tsrc=\"https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/Venery-Acland-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1860\" height=\"2560\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/Venery-Acland-scaled.jpg 1860w, https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/Venery-Acland-218x300.jp