LL, SCA and DM. Our terriers compete in all aspects at terrier trials around the country.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div><div id=\"panel-1263-0-0-1\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_text panel-last-child\" data-index=\"1\" >\t\t\t<div class=\"textwidget\"><h4>Also at Stud:<\/h4>\n<p><strong>RUN AWAY FARM FITZ,<\/strong> <em>12&#8243;, Tricolor, Broken<\/em><br \/>\n<em>(Inseguire Scandal x Run Away Farm Brunello)<br \/>\nPLL, SCA, and DM Normal, CERF Clear, BAER Normal<\/em><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><strong>We strongly adhere to the JRTCA Breeders Code of Ethics and fully educate the prospective owner to make sure that the Jack Russell is truly that type of dog that they want. We love to introduce new people to the breed and give demonstrations in racing and go-to-ground. Visitors are welcome to come to the farm to play.<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-1263-0-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-1263-0-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image panel-first-child\" data-index=\"2\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-8b5b6f678277-1263\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tsrc=\"https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/Run-Away-Farm-Milligan.jpg\" width=\"457\" height=\"323\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/Run-Away-Farm-Milligan.jpg 457w, https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/Run-Away-Farm-Milligan-300x212.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 457px) 100vw, 457px\" title=\"RUN AWAY FARM FIRE CRACKER, 12\u00bc&quot;, Tricolor, Broken (Run Away Farm Fitz x Run Away Farm Tally Ho) PLL, SCA, and DM Normal, CERF Clear, BAER Normal\" alt=\"\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image\"\/>\n\t<\/div>\n\n<h3 class=\"widget-title\">RUN AWAY FARM FIRE CRACKER, 12\u00bc\", Tricolor, Broken (Run Away Farm Fitz x Run Away Farm Tally Ho) PLL, SCA, and DM Normal, CERF Clear, BAER Normal<\/h3><\/div><\/div><div 