 quality Jack Russell Terriers with excellent temperaments, conformation, health, and working instincts. Our program focus is preserving the older working bloodlines. We love the tenacity, curiosity, and heritage these little white dogs bring to our kennel and to the lives of the families who bring them home. Our terriers are regularly health screened to ensure healthy parents and offspring and are raised in our home as members of our family.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div><div id=\"panel-1097-0-0-1\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_text panel-last-child\" data-index=\"1\" >\t\t\t<div class=\"textwidget\"><h4>Our Boys:<\/h4>\n<p><strong>SHAVANO CREEK SAMPSON, <\/strong>NHC,\u00a0<em>12\u00bd&#8221;, Tricolor, Smooth<\/em><br \/>\n<em>(Rustling Oaks LeoNardo x Inseguire Serenade)<br \/>\nBronze Medallion for special merit in the field &amp; Working Achievement Award<\/em><\/p>\n<p><strong>SHAVANO CREEK OLIVER,<\/strong> <em>12\u00bc&#8221;, Tan\/White, Lightly Broken<\/em><br \/>\n<em>(Rustling Oaks Leonardo x High Range Ambush)<br \/>\n<\/em><\/p>\n<p><strong>HIDDEN ACRES BOUNTY,<\/strong> <em>13&#8243;, Tricolor, Broken<\/em><br \/>\n<em>(High Range Bull x Forever Young Mel-A-Baby)<\/em><\/p>\n<p><strong>SHAVANO CREEK AXEL, <\/strong><em>13&#8243;, Tricolor, Broken<\/em><br \/>\n<em>(Brooks Chase Jude x Shavano Creek Tesla)<br \/>\n<\/em><\/p>\n<p><strong>FAIR DINKUM OUTLAW<\/strong><em>, 12\u00bd&#8221;, Tricolor, Lighlty Broken<\/em><br \/>\n<em>(Shavano Creek Oliver x Shingle Oak Lady Grace<\/em><em>)<\/em><\/p>\n<p><strong>FAIR DINKUM ROCKY<\/strong><em>, 12\u00be&#8221;, Tricolor, Smooth<\/em><br \/>\n<em>(British Grit Ranger x Shingle Oak Lady Grace<\/em><em>)<\/em><\/p>\n<p><strong>SHAVANO CREEK BOONE,<\/strong> <em>13\u00be&#8221;, Tricolor, Smooth<\/em><br \/>\n<em>(Brooks Chase Jude x Indian Creek Sakura)<\/em><\/p>\n<h4>Our Girls:<\/h4>\n<p><strong>MONTRAVE MORAG,<\/strong> <em>12\u00bd&#8221;, Tricolor, Broken<\/em><br \/>\n<em>(That&#8217;s Enuff Jude x Montrave Aofie<\/em><em>)<br \/>\nUK Champion Bloodlines<\/em><\/p>\n<p><strong>SHAVANO CREEK AMAZING GRACE,<\/strong><em>\u00a012\u00bd&#8221;, White, Broken<\/em><br \/>\n<em>(Shavano Creek Sampson x Montrave Morag<\/em><em>)<\/em><\/p>\n<p><strong>INDIAN CREEK SAKURA,<\/strong>\u00a0<em>12\u00bd&#8221;, Tan\/White, Smooth<\/em><br \/>\n<em>(Northgate Knox x Brooks Chase Mz. Dottie<\/em><em>)<\/em><\/p>\n<p><strong>AVALANCHE ACRES ABIGAIL,<\/strong>\u00a0<em>12\u00bd&#8221;, Rough<br \/>\n<\/em><em>(Legendary Ace x Avalanche Acres Luna<\/em><em>)<\/em><\/p>\n<p><strong>SHAVANO CREEK MCKENZIE,<\/strong><em> 12\u00be&#8221;, Tan\/White, Smooth<\/em><br \/>\n<em>(Brooks Chase Jude x Indian Creek Sakura)<\/em><\/p>\n<p><strong>SHAVANO CREEK HULLABALLO,\u00a0<\/strong>12\u00bd&#8221;, Tan\/White, Broken<br \/>\n<em>(Brooks Chase Jude x Indian Creek Sakura)<\/em><\/p>\n<h4>Introducing:<\/h4>\n<p><strong>BROOKS CHASE DIVA<\/strong><br \/>\n<em>(Shavano Creek Sampson x Brooks Chase Sundance)<\/em><\/p>\n<p><strong>Please visit our website for more information. We&#8217;d love to hear from you!<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-1097-0-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-1097-0-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image panel-first-child\" data-index=\"2\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-8b5b6f678277-1097\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tsrc=\"https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/Shavano-Creek-Thompson.jpg\" width=\"1464\" height=\"1028\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/Shavano-Creek-Thompson.jpg 1464w, https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/Shavano-Creek-Thompson-300x211.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/Shavano-Creek-Thompson-1024x719.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/Shavano-Creek-Thomps