 Broken<br \/>\n(Full sister to Run Away Farm Strider)\u00a0<\/em><br \/>\n<em>Multiple Conformation Class wins<\/em><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-785-0-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-785-0-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image panel-first-child\" data-index=\"2\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-8b5b6f678277-785\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tsrc=\"https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/Run-Away-Farm-Strider-cropped.jpg\" width=\"551\" height=\"446\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/Run-Away-Farm-Strider-cropped.jpg 551w, https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/Run-Away-Farm-Strider-cropped-300x243.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 551px) 100vw, 551px\" title=\"RUN AWAY FARM STRIDER, 13\u00bc&quot;, Tan\/White, Broken. Bronze Medallion, 2023 High Score Working Terrier Dog, 2023 JRTCA Nationals Best Family, 2024 JRTCA Nationals Working Champion, 2025 JRTCA Reserve High Point Working Terrier Conformation (behind his son Hart Farms Tidal Wave) Sire of Bronze earner, 3 JRTCA High Point Conformation Winners &amp; Multiple other NHC earners &amp; Conformation Champions\" alt=\"\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image\"\/>\n\t<\/div>\n\n<h3 class=\"widget-title\">RUN AWAY FARM STRIDER, 13\u00bc\", Tan\/White, Broken. Bronze Medallion, 2023 High Score Working Terrier Dog, 2023 JRTCA Nationals Best Family, 2024 JRTCA Nationals Working Champion, 2025 JRTCA Reserve High Point Working Terrier Conformation (behind his son Hart Farms Tidal Wave) Sire of Bronze earner, 3 JRTCA High Point Conformation Winners &amp; Multiple other NHC earners &amp; Conformation Champions<\/h3><\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-785-0-1-1\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_text\" data-index=\"3\" ><div class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-785-0-1-1\" ><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Con