t":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=309"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=309"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=309"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":349,"date":"2019-05-28T16:16:46","date_gmt":"2019-05-28T20:16:46","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/?p=349"},"modified":"2026-07-02T14:07:53","modified_gmt":"2026-07-02T18:07:53","slug":"jackn-around","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/jackn-around\/","title":{"rendered":"Jack&#8217;n Around"},"content":{"rendered":"<div id=\"pl-349\"  class=\"panel-layout\" ><div id=\"pg-349-0\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-349-0-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-349-0-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_text panel-first-child\" data-index=\"0\" ><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Cache, Oklahoma<\/h3>\t\t\t<div class=\"textwidget\"><p>We have been happily owned by our Jack Russells for over 27 years and we cannot imagine life without them! We are committed to producing a well-rounded terrier that has correct conformation and a great temperament. Our passion is to raise the All-Around Athlete. Performance of our terriers is what we strive for, be it in the field, competing at a JRTCA trial or just playing at home! I am out with my terriers just as often as possible in the field or at a trial. I am always excited to help anyone get more involved with their terriers. There is nothing more fun than working with your terrier doing what they naturally love. Our pups are raised in our home and experience many different challenges from a very young age. All of our dogs are health tested and the results can be found on the JRT Health Registry website. They are well-socialized, ready to join your family as a companion and\/or competitor.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div><div id=\"panel-349-0-0-1\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_text panel-last-child\" data-index=\"1\" >\t\t\t<div class=\"textwidget\"><h4>OUR GIRLS:<\/h4>\n<p><i>Wonderful\u00a0pets, excellent mothers and amazing competitors:<\/i><\/p>\n<p><b>JACK&#8217;N AROUND SEAR&#8217;S EMBER<\/b><b>, <\/b><em>12&#8243;, Tricolor, Rough<\/em> <i><br \/>\n(Bona-Venture Biscotti x Leap&#8217;n River Lulu)<br \/>\nThis sweet girl has amazed me! We enjoyed an amazing puppy career and has done very well as an adult.<br \/>\nCan&#8217;t wait to see what&#8217;s next!<\/i><\/p>\n<p><b>JACK&#8217;N AROUND JUDY<\/b><b>, <\/b><em>13\u00bc&#8221;, Tricolor, Rough<\/em> <i><br \/>\n(Leap&#8217;n River Boo x Jack&#8217;n Around ForeverMaureen)<br \/>\nThis girl is more than I could ever wish for! She already has some nice wins and excels at everything she tries!<br \/>\nShe reminds me of her GGGgrandma, Maddie. I am so happy to have her!<\/i><\/p>\n<p><b>JACK&#8217;N AROUND STELLA, <\/b><em>13\u00be&#8221;, Black\/White<\/em><em>, Broken<\/em><i><br \/>\n(Down-N-Dirty Venom x Jack&#8217;n Around Diamond Girl)<br \/>\nStella is a beautiful girl with an amazing black &amp; white, lightly broken coat. She is my wild child<br \/>\nand showing lots of promise at trials. I am looking forward to years of fun with this girl!<\/i><\/p>\n<h4>OUR BOYS:<\/h4>\n<p><b>DIGGIN WEST JITTERBUG, <\/b><em>14&#8243;, Tricolor<\/em><em>, Rough<\/em><i><br \/>\n(Allstar Fozzie x Diggin West Jive)<br \/>\nThis beautiful guy has an amazing temperament, nice bone, and coat. He has done very well in the ring,<br \/>\nand he has produced beautiful pups that are performing well! Limited availability for approved bitches.<\/i><\/p>\n<p><b>JACK&#8217;N AROUND HERCULES, <\/b><em>11\u00bc&#8221;, Tricolor<\/em><em>, Broken<\/em><i><br \/>\n(Birch Creek Henchman x Jack&#8217;n Around Sear&#8217;s Ember)<br \/>\nThis is the little man of my dreams, although he is mischievous! He is a mighty little guy with a huge drive and personality! He is already winning at trials.<br \/>\nI am so excited to have him in my program and can&#8217;t wait to see what he does next!<\/i><\/p>\n<h4>INTRODUCING:<\/h4>\n<p><b>JACK&#8217;N AROUND JEWEL<\/b><i><br \/>\n<\/i><\/p>\n<p><i>Please feel free to call,\u00a0I\u00a0love to talk terrier!<\/i><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-349-0-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-349-0-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image panel-first-child\" data-index=\"2\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-8b5b6f678277-349\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tsrc=\"https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/Jack_n_Around.jpg\" width=\"300\" height=\"407\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/Jack_n_Around.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.jrtcabreeders.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/Jack_n_Around-221x300.jpg 221w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" title=\"JACK&#039;N AROUND IZZABELL\" alt=\"\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image\"\/>\n\t<\/div>\n\n<h3 class=\"widget-title\">JACK'N AROUND IZZABELL<\/h3><\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-349-0-1-1\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_text\" data-index=\"3\" ><div class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-349-0-1-1\" ><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Contact Information<\/h3>\t\t\t<div class=\"textwidget\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-349-0-1-2\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-button\" data-index=\"4\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-button so-widget-sow-button-flat-d8b0bf90787c-349\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t><div class=\"ow-button-base ow-button-align-left\"\n>\n\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\thref=\"\/contact\/?b=Demo%20Breeder%20One\"\n\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"sowb-button ow-icon-placement-left ow-button-hover\" \t>\n\t\t<span>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tContact Breeder\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><di